  "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/blogger/v3/blogs/1732826187557117921/posts/640416767121254267",
  "title": "One-Day Culinary Travel to Zambia: A Diary Entry From Behind the KLTG Desk",
  "content": "\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-fbe838a0-7fff-d311-3613-47f26fe6602d\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 18pt; text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: normal; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eThere’s a specific kind of magic that happens when an editorial team stops rushing. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 18pt; text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: normal; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003eMost days behind the KLTG desk, our workspace is a battleground of glowing laptop screens, half-edited drafts of city trails, and half-cold coffees.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWe are constantly chasing the city's pulse. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBut today, the frantic rhythm of typing suddenly dissolved, replaced by something deeply grounding: the rich, aromatic steam of an authentic Zambian feast.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWe didn’t just take a lunch break. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWe flipped open a hidden palate passport and went on an unscripted, one-day culinary travel journey across the globe without leaving our chairs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eBreaking the Bread of Africa\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAt the absolute center of our table sat a massive, pristine mound of steaming \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eNshima\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIn Zambian culture, Nshima isn't just a side dish; it is the literal and emotional anchor of life. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMade from ground maize white cornmeal that is vigorously whipped into a dense, smooth porridge-like, it holds a comforting heat.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThere’s a beautiful, tactile intimacy to eating it. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIt gently demands that you abandon your cutlery and embrace a hands-on heritage. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWe watched each other try it for the first time, taking a small piece, kneading it in the palm of our hand until it became a pliable little disc, and then shaping it into a scoop to catch the sauces.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-xyxiVWSdVzvUlB-i8klpBzjn_vqfne9dAw2H6S3_7aJtkoI2YZHK8Gva9GpnzOG_xW5ZTTGgRdcacxehO00ewv0WbKwJxJDc391d_ca0tthq70gkubpiaD4-8l3gYi7cQjnMCz-zimejqOGdtaYkGNXkqRHb2MTJt8VT4A4DTfdP4uzJrRMqz2uGIEge/s2017/IMG_20260521_5263718.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2017\" data-original-width=\"1792\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi-xyxiVWSdVzvUlB-i8klpBzjn_vqfne9dAw2H6S3_7aJtkoI2YZHK8Gva9GpnzOG_xW5ZTTGgRdcacxehO00ewv0WbKwJxJDc391d_ca0tthq70gkubpiaD4-8l3gYi7cQjnMCz-zimejqOGdtaYkGNXkqRHb2MTJt8VT4A4DTfdP4uzJrRMqz2uGIEge/w568-h640/IMG_20260521_5263718.png\" width=\"568\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: xx-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eRight beside it was a golden platter of \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eEgg Fried Rice\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhile not traditionally Zambian, it sat there like a gentle, familiar bridge between cultures. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eFlecked with soft egg and savory seasoning, it provided a welcoming, neutral baseline that made the bold, exotic flavors around it feel right at home.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhOrikNhsAwaC7vi06K9WVEBJ_xFYPRNU9EEbtqL78Cgas1jFSzvuFFrCPDMBOk4TH_nh9LuRdX4kteEnSFH_0Pbfos8LvC3y_3DpMqG4W2OnyFkWVzotC47BF204FMmNov_sgGV7ue6uJmxvrR2JpaukOoyxqQM2cGGGLV_u8gZwitsEqqpkZYT-Yzmi5H/s803/IMG_20260521_5637183.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"803\" data-original-width=\"768\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhOrikNhsAwaC7vi06K9WVEBJ_xFYPRNU9EEbtqL78Cgas1jFSzvuFFrCPDMBOk4TH_nh9LuRdX4kteEnSFH_0Pbfos8LvC3y_3DpMqG4W2OnyFkWVzotC47BF204FMmNov_sgGV7ue6uJmxvrR2JpaukOoyxqQM2cGGGLV_u8gZwitsEqqpkZYT-Yzmi5H/w612-h640/IMG_20260521_5637183.jpg\" width=\"612\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: xx-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eStews That Tell a Story\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eOxtail\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e was a masterclass in patience. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSlow-simmered for hours until the gelatinous meat literally dissolved off the bone at the touch of a finger, it was bathed in a rich, glossy, deeply savory reduction. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003ePouring that luxurious gravy over the Nshima felt like a warm hug on a rainy afternoon.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEic1Vqk0S_y17rBYT6uG5h3xgah1xEUTyGXsEqz6TpcKyhZEb3oar_U-wbLKvCd8FYc7xZH_LPc3POrjXOdJh-pFdVK4ijQs9g4XbKV0_Jj1XgCwwkWARRBZrbS3z_KxFkOZkDF82JgAMMpqBq7aKU77rlwT1Ak1kbIOuXhM3LToMmkvAc3D6dZ_te0tIP2/s2085/IMG_20260521_5162618.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2085\" data-original-width=\"1792\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEic1Vqk0S_y17rBYT6uG5h3xgah1xEUTyGXsEqz6TpcKyhZEb3oar_U-wbLKvCd8FYc7xZH_LPc3POrjXOdJh-pFdVK4ijQs9g4XbKV0_Jj1XgCwwkWARRBZrbS3z_KxFkOZkDF82JgAMMpqBq7aKU77rlwT1Ak1kbIOuXhM3LToMmkvAc3D6dZ_te0tIP2/w548-h640/IMG_20260521_5162618.png\" width=\"548\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eTo balance the decadence of the meat, we passed around the bowl of \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eChilemba\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThis hearty bean stew is a staple of Zambian home-cooking. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe sugar beans are boiled slowly with onions and tomatoes until they reach a velvety, melt-in-your-mouth texture, creating a thick, earthy broth that carries a subtle, natural sweetness.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjplAeQnuf1CfwUAARNEQqpKIFia-bO8hppXFO8UjuqN-DK5V8MF64vfmT7znr-tx0HtRpBSz3oe5b_ZyPg7Al8A1CabIV2uzwZ_z1ajWMV9cGBQEdfX8oYklEtWTGyM_4S19yBqBJ-MhlprSpbNaUdmGf0A0PQdyfkuTdsR8DCuCt5xtgzy7voT2zW1F30/s870/IMG_20260521_6278391.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"870\" data-original-width=\"734\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjplAeQnuf1CfwUAARNEQqpKIFia-bO8hppXFO8UjuqN-DK5V8MF64vfmT7znr-tx0HtRpBSz3oe5b_ZyPg7Al8A1CabIV2uzwZ_z1ajWMV9cGBQEdfX8oYklEtWTGyM_4S19yBqBJ-MhlprSpbNaUdmGf0A0PQdyfkuTdsR8DCuCt5xtgzy7voT2zW1F30/w539-h640/IMG_20260521_6278391.jpg\" width=\"539\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe Green Canvas: Visashi and Rape\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eZambian cuisine has a brilliant way of treating vegetables not as an afterthought, but as a highlight. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eWe fell in love with \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eVisashi\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIt’s a traditional dish where leafy green vegetables are stewed down in a rich, creamy sauce made from raw, pounded peanuts or groundnuts.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhx6gOPVQX-mRwp2fiWVLOWRUYKnwJixCx32awod8BvE1GILDJ8tUxZGrmgzu0Pg1T1sQfFvl-Nk6H2vhMEzC3UEHeG2Dvn4gh6Gc6qHmrwS8B4pE4FsDREk_1OYJrsKIAPCr7zE5rogEiRuzcCKZeCdzBdgn9c68IGF9rzK0oN02TOxAfq7Klz3_Kia0a-/s2045/IMG_20260521_5323213.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2045\" data-original-width=\"1792\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhx6gOPVQX-mRwp2fiWVLOWRUYKnwJixCx32awod8BvE1GILDJ8tUxZGrmgzu0Pg1T1sQfFvl-Nk6H2vhMEzC3UEHeG2Dvn4gh6Gc6qHmrwS8B4pE4FsDREk_1OYJrsKIAPCr7zE5rogEiRuzcCKZeCdzBdgn9c68IGF9rzK0oN02TOxAfq7Klz3_Kia0a-/w563-h640/IMG_20260521_5323213.png\" width=\"563\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eNext to it was \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eRape\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e, which is savory, sautéed mustard greens. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eKept simple and flash-fried with just a hint of oil, tomatoes, and onions, it preserved its bright, peppery bite. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eIt acted as the perfect, crisp palate cleanser between the richer, heavier stews.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhKpKQMl61jxCGXUSOU01DBhz9sokjPHn75ZgPQZ0Gh9b0hsr2pi9ES1laeXRdUpoH2Yg6UA0M6Dyp9b0PCWSki4HBEopkzOk71KYQjFfDzDyo5Vnc7WY-OmmzZdC3DzRshyphenhyphen_WoLlWBD7bmt-Yt1GH7PaoE8MU6aT9Qqd5To-DCAMpGi4wGG4SnaxZcAMAW/s792/IMG_20260521_7832993.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"792\" data-original-width=\"768\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhKpKQMl61jxCGXUSOU01DBhz9sokjPHn75ZgPQZ0Gh9b0hsr2pi9ES1laeXRdUpoH2Yg6UA0M6Dyp9b0PCWSki4HBEopkzOk71KYQjFfDzDyo5Vnc7WY-OmmzZdC3DzRshyphenhyphen_WoLlWBD7bmt-Yt1GH7PaoE8MU6aT9Qqd5To-DCAMpGi4wGG4SnaxZcAMAW/w620-h640/IMG_20260521_7832993.jpg\" width=\"620\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-top: 14pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eNew Textures That Sparked the Room\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAs a part of publication, we live for the moments that surprise us. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe real magic of the afternoon happened when we ventured into the authentic delicacies, turning our lunch into a playful sensory lab.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eFirst was \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eKapenta\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThese tiny, sun-dried fish from Lake Tanganyika were shallow-fried with onions and tomatoes until they achieved an immaculate, golden crisp. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eEach bite delivered an intense, smoky burst of umami and a satisfying crunch that had us reaching back into the bowl like we were eating gourmet chips.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCk-RlX8fb2cAYG-0hBldGNq5ITUTD28a4lKvbdoFg-_M4JvXo1LUqx2LwNaIrxZMrRytRaWyymNeRXCz_tIjobaoZmq7ZIfEfKy9u_8CcA2aDn_PJyIgqA_vaq-V1lYKIRawpxeR7-nT9kgJTU95CZgT2TAH9vXe5LW5DS1YjveQhLpr_da_xpiK1vB_o/s1792/IMG_20260521_7839189.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1403\" data-original-width=\"1792\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiCk-RlX8fb2cAYG-0hBldGNq5ITUTD28a4lKvbdoFg-_M4JvXo1LUqx2LwNaIrxZMrRytRaWyymNeRXCz_tIjobaoZmq7ZIfEfKy9u_8CcA2aDn_PJyIgqA_vaq-V1lYKIRawpxeR7-nT9kgJTU95CZgT2TAH9vXe5LW5DS1YjveQhLpr_da_xpiK1vB_o/w640-h500/IMG_20260521_7839189.png\" width=\"640\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eNext was \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eDelele\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e. This unique okra dish introduced us to a whole new texture. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCooked with a touch of bicarbonate of soda to give it a wonderfully smooth, slippery, and viscous consistency, it is traditionally designed to help the dense Nshima slide down smoothly. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgTzvBwj7itXpwuUw1ZDplAPQmtES-3PkTY7ThxYnreNHlZsPZHkOAOFyLOG8HEIF2BuEO2GNpwj27D7wtRcWGRlHVG1n547DuCPk03BucOsDYA6HHwvq3w-SIt5ipg8-zyCgsewyoihWaBBxn3QWt6kgrECA-ly_ZPf33sI324hhNNZqP1uG5ggisbs_M5/s842/IMG_20260521_7383771.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"842\" data-original-width=\"768\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgTzvBwj7itXpwuUw1ZDplAPQmtES-3PkTY7ThxYnreNHlZsPZHkOAOFyLOG8HEIF2BuEO2GNpwj27D7wtRcWGRlHVG1n547DuCPk03BucOsDYA6HHwvq3w-SIt5ipg8-zyCgsewyoihWaBBxn3QWt6kgrECA-ly_ZPf33sI324hhNNZqP1uG5ggisbs_M5/w585-h640/IMG_20260521_7383771.jpg\" width=\"585\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: x-small;\"\u003eImage Source : BGOC Internal\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eThen came the true showstopper, the \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; font-weight: 700; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eVinkubala\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e, which are sautéed mopane worms. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eSeasoned perfectly and fried until crisp, they gave off a deeply earthy, nutty flavor with a distinct crunch. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: inherit;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: medium; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eTrying them became a beautiful test of shared courage for the team.&nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 12pt; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj6WOi-ivwJhvFuYrbUxEBehWiW-qWgjM5AUdDBwlyxWyyTZbIv5EmKkxaXRojOMzi-InjQLM9of6NiVCDuWcZECTKYbMcGKPsy34ZifSHsy0L5i7sElQjkb-bizW0HBSZ5_EO4KuvKzqC-8y2hAX3ZDgVtvh7yLeID1soinDEcBTZ-rbZpmStwxMlIHtkU/s927/IMG_20260521_5162248.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"\u003e\u003cimg border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"927\" data-original-width=\"768\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj6WOi-ivwJhvFuYrbUxEBehWiW-qWgjM5AUdDBwlyxWyyTZbIv5EmKkxaXRojOMzi-InjQLM9of6NiVCDuWcZECTKYbMcGKP